msgid "Power Off"
msgstr "关机"

msgid "Shut down the device. Physical access is required to turn it on again."
msgstr "关闭设备。再次开机需要物理接触设备（按电源键或重新通电）。"

msgid "Perform power off"
msgstr "执行关机"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Are you sure you want to power off the device?"
msgstr "确定要关闭设备吗？"

msgid "The device is shutting down. You can unplug the power once the LEDs turn off."
msgstr "设备正在关机，指示灯熄灭后即可断电。"
